Output examples/demo/out/choose.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 500
Set FontSize 22
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "cat examples/inputs/kaguya.txt | ./xylitol.sh choose --page-size=8"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Right
Sleep 1.2s
Left
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
